---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy">
  <section class="section"><div class="wrap prose">
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="muted">Draft for review before launch.</p>
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>When you sign up for emails, download a chart or send an inquiry, we collect what you enter (such as your name and email address) and which page you signed up from. We also use analytics and advertising tools (Google Analytics, Google Ads and Meta) to understand how the site is used, only with your consent where required.</p>
    <h2>How we use it</h2>
    <p>To send the emails you asked for, reply to inquiries, and improve the site and our ministry. We never sell your information.</p>
    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>Every email has an unsubscribe link. To have your information removed, contact us through the inquiry form.</p>
  </div></section>
</Base>
